00:29:17.000 --> 00:29:42.000
but it's not because of anything else than the fact that hope is a function of who is around you either saying, you know, fueling the fire or throwing water on it. So if you happen to find a life where you can make meaning and there are others around you who can, you know, add fuel to that fire and egg you on. And you can deauthorize those who are causing harm to you, which is not always easy, right?

